The '''Century Party Invitation''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Century Party Invitation''' can be obtained as a Minor Reward during [[Raffle of the Century]] event, or from the {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

==Usage== 
The player can click on any other player while holding a '''Century Party Invitation''' to add the level color to the item.
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|
&d&lPARTY! &b<player>&e's SkyBlock level color is &8[&b<level>&8] - [&b<level>&8] &b<color>&f!
&aYou invited &b<player> &ato the &dCentury Party&a!
}}}}

If the level color has already been found, the result will be:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|
&d&lPARTY! &b<player>&e's SkyBlock level color is &8[&b<level>&8] - [&b<level>&8] &b<color>&f!
&cYou already have this SkyBlock level color in your invitation!
}}}}

Finding each level color will reset the item and grant the player a permanent {{stat|social wisdom|+1}} and {{coins|250,000}}. The player may only gain the bonus once.
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|
&d&lPARTY! &aYour Century Party has reached max capacity, and you gained its permanent bonus!
&eThat also comes with a one-time reward of &6250,000 Coins&e!
}}}}

The bonus is a one time reward. If the player finds all level color again they will receive nothing but a message in chat.
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|
&d&lPARTY! &aYour Party has reached max capacity!
&aYou had already gained the bonus, so... at least everyone is now invited!
}}}}

